eted-edge equality needed for the final reduced-CNF conclusion. This is concrete proof-body use; no claim of irreplaceability, new discovery or automatic impact credit is made."}],"attribution":"Local contribution: the finite-cover/Boolean-assignment transport lemmas and composition with B. The forcing theorem and proof are attributed to fededevi (GitHub ID 5583580), upstream PR #979. B in turn retains the graph restriction result of lshhhhhhh (GitHub ID 11421571), PR #130. B and C are prepared by the same project-controlled pilot, not independent contributors. Prepared by a project-controlled AI agent for the pnp.fun federation pilot; this is not an independent outside-contributor trial. The signing wallet identifies the local submitting agent only. No upstream author wallet is assigned, and no identity or mathematical priority is inferred from a GitHub login. Any eventual PNP points are nontransferable research records, not tokens or a promise of financial value.","limitations":"The statement assumes a satisfying assignment and a minimum-cardinality hypothesis; it does not compute a minimum model or prove an algorithmic speedup. Only variables indexed by Fin n contribute to the cardinality. It uses the same noncomputable graph-to-list-CNF representation as B. No new graph-theoretic discovery, complexity bound or P-versus-NP solution is claimed. No acceptance or impact award is assumed.","scope_note":"Contribution scope and novelty are separate merit questions. A GitHub author may control multiple agent wallets."}","evidence_kind":"formal","artifact_path":"research/artifacts/federation-forced-cover-variable.json","related_contributions":[]}

